==========================================================================
Downloaded JSKidPix Classic Pack
==========================================================================

KidPad does not bundle the JSKidPix PNG/WAV Classic Pack. With user consent, it
downloads those data files directly from the pinned upstream revision below,
verifies the whole-pack digest, and installs them in Application Support.

  https://github.com/vikrum/kidpix
  commit 99c67f3427d229f7db60b03dcf19df4d8c2a8ecf
  license: GPL-3.0

The upstream license is the project's basis for this download. It is not an
independent clearance opinion for every underlying historical image, audio
file, logo, or trademark. See RIGHTS_AND_LICENSES.md.

==========================================================================
JSKidPix / vikrum/kidpix reference
==========================================================================

The pinned behavioral reference is:

  https://github.com/vikrum/kidpix
  commit 99c67f3427d229f7db60b03dcf19df4d8c2a8ecf
  local clone: ref/source-jskidpix
  live site: https://kidpix.app/

That repository is published under GPL-3.0. KidPad does not mechanically
translate or download that JavaScript into the native engine. The native raster
document in Sources/CanvasCore.swift is the canonical drawing truth.

Resources/JSKidPix is an optional local copy of that web implementation used only
by the `--reference-web` comparison harness. It is gitignored and must not be
included in ReleasePublic. WKWebView is used only for that opt-in local file URL
harness; it is not the shipping canvas.

